WIP kernel for the T-Mobile Revvl 6 Pro/T-Phone Pro 2023

(may not reflect current commit and your device)

What works:
Battery gauge
GPU
CPU
Most of the sensors

What partially works:
Audio (Headphone jack, earpiece speaker, Main speaker doesn't work.)
Display (If display turns off it can't turn on; BOE panel not tested.)
Touchscreen (Touch is all wonky)
Modem (Mobile data, calls and SMS aren't tested.)
Side buttons (Volume up and power don't work)
USB (OTG doesn't work)

What doesn't:
Fingerprint
Camera
Connectivity (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth)
Hardware decoding
Hardware encoding

